<par def='10'><run><font size='7pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='#ba5700'/>Order detail is shown below.  The total extended price does not include handling, tax, or fees for custom items.</run></par>
<par def='10'><run><font size='7pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='#ba5700'/>Innerface makes every effort to ensure that accurate pricing is shown on this web site. However, should pricing discrepancies arise, you will be contacted by an Innerface Customer Service representative.</run></par>
