>"IntelliPRINT Formats"</formula></code><code event='queryopen'><lotusscript
>Sub Queryopen(Source As Notesuidocument, Mode As Integer, Isnewdoc As Variant, Continue As Variant)
     If mode = 1 Then
          Msgbox "Use the IntelliPRINT function in the Action menu to change this document"
          continue = False
     End If
End Sub
</lotusscript></code><code event='querymodechange'><lotusscript>Sub Querymodechange(Source As Notesuidocument, Continue As Variant)
     
     Msgbox "Use the IntelliPRINT function in the Action menu to change this document"
     continue = False
     
End Sub</lotusscript></code>
<body><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='7.5000in' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'
 hide='read edit copy preview previewedit'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>Project:  Format Database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>Database Name: IPFormat.nsf</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>FormName (with alias name): </run><run
><font size='8pt' color='green'/>$IPFormatForm</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>Lotus Notes Version: 4.6.1(International)</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>Author(s):  Eileen Vesely</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='8pt' color='green'/>Date of creation: 10/24/99              </run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%'/>
<par def='2'>       <run><font size='8pt' color='green'/> </run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold'/>Purpose of this document: This form is not directly composed.  It is here just so you can see that IntelliPRINT stores its Formats in a Notes Document.  This is useful knowledge, because you can do a lookup for Format names and present the end user a list of Formats, depending on the situation.  What is being displayed here is a result of using the IntelliPRINT editor.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold'/>Folder:</run> <field type='text' kind='editable'
 name='FolderPath'/></par>
<par def='2'/>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold'/>Name:</run> <field type='text' kind='editable'
 name='FormatName'/></par>
<par def='2'/>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold'/>Comment:</run> <field type='text' kind='editable'
 name='Comment'/></par>
<par def='2'/></richtext></body>
<item name='$$ScriptName' summary='false' sign='true'><text>$IPFormatForm</text></item></form>

